+ * @param[in] max   Maximum number of nested acquisitions by the owner.
+ *                  Must be greater than 0.
+ *
+ * @return 1 if mutex was acquired (including when the calling thread
+ *         already owns the mutex and the nesting limit has not been reached).
+ * @return 0 if the calling thread already owns the mutex and the maximum
+ *         number of nested acquisitions has been reached.
